      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Side by side other process ko chalane\nmein help karta hai\nMain process ko bina interrupt kare\nother processes ko side stack mein\nchalata hai.",
